  <notes>
    Completed 2026-10-04 (subagent, wave UAT4-W1). Full record: notes/096-email-tab.md.
    - Word Email tab (Save · To Do · Find · Email), gated on new capability canEmailFromPane (Word true, Outlook false);
      task 086's Send Email row removed; Outlook's native Send Email unchanged.
    - The "shared compose components" named in the background are the READING-PANE components; the email page's
      form is EmailComposer (@spaarke/ui-components). The tab mounts it through a new thin shared wrapper
      SendEmailPane (ADR-045 "new mount = new thin wrapper"), by exact webpack/jest alias to source; types via an
      ambient shim (shared/types/spaarke-send-email-pane.d.ts). lexical 0.41.0 added to the add-in.
    - Send = existing POST /api/communications/send, sendMode User, attachmentDocumentIds [documentId],
      associations [related record, logical name], archiveToSpe false. No BFF change.
    - No client path mints a sharing link; shareLinkService.ts + suite deleted; Outlook body links the Spaarke
      document record.
    - Gates: gated jest 75/75 suites, 1031/1031; lint 0; typecheck 68 total / 0 production (= CI pin); shared
      wrappers.test 14/14; webpack build exit 0 (run twice — the second proved the scoped resolve change).
    - Step 9.5: adr-check found an ADR-045 deviation (direct engine mount) → Path C (SendEmailPane). code-review:
      1 Critical (server, escalated), W3/W4/W5/W6/W8 + S2/S4/S6/S7/S8 fixed; table in notes §8.
    - OPEN: live send from Word (AC 10). Escalated: app-only attachment read + association with no caller-access
      check on the send route (security); share-link route recommendation (notes §4); archiveToSpe default bug.
  </notes>

